        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Rising Cloud City is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile equipment fielded in Crazed Demon Cave, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Miao Yin controls Rising Cloud City as she is about to charge, when legendary immemorial beasts Shabi Ninety-five and Ruan Dan pincer attack from left and right. She uses a killer move and the house spews endless cloud qi to push upward, but Ruan Dan flies above, slashes with a crane leg, shatters the roof, and destroys countless mortal Gu. Shabi Ninety-five then knocks Rising Cloud City over so it rolls down the mountain; Fairy Miao Yin pours immortal essence without response until Demon Immortal Qi Jue uses Xi Xi and Xi Land absorbs a qi ring from the house’s surface, after which Rising Cloud City regains freedom. On Fang Yuan’s order she evacuates the Gu Immortals and gifts Rising Cloud City to Demon Immortal Qi Jue; he enters, flies up, and attacks the mountain again. He later keeps the house while fighting Shabi Ninety-five, then brings it out again when Ruan Dan spat a bright red pill; the pill detonates on Rising Cloud City and destroys a corner, a new pill path strike the house cannot guard against.",
      "chapters": [
        2179
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "field-combat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_miao_yin",
        "char_shabi_ninety_five",
        "char_ruan_dan",
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "char_demon_immortal_qi_jue",
        "move_xi_xi",
        "loc_xi_land",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bing Sai Chuan notes that Fang Yuan had seven Immortal Gu Houses, and that after Rising Cloud City was given to Demon Immortal Qi Jue and four houses moved away, only Unbreakable Golden Fortress and Scarlet Palace remain on Book Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        2181
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "remaining-houses",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "loc_book_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Immortal Zombie Giant Sun enters Primordial Domain, Fang Yuan looks toward Rising Cloud City and asks Qi Jue to cooperate again. Demon Immortal Qi Jue flies over from Rising Cloud City, saying he knew Fang Yuan had ulterior motives in gifting the rank eight Immortal Gu House, then agrees to work together.",
      "chapters": [
        2184
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cooperation-request",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_immortal_zombie_giant_sun",
        "loc_primordial_domain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later counts that the seven Immortal Gu Houses he took out in Crazed Demon Cave, including Rising Cloud City, were all lost.",
      "chapters": [
        2215
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cave-house-losses",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
